{"4853700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stillwake", "steam_appid": 4853700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/db5e421f727210ce2f7199c47aed7900.avif?t=1788205057\" width=735 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StillWake -</strong> is an atmospheric first-person survival horror game set in an abandoned psychiatric hospital on a remote island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Blake Hale, works as a detective. In his childhood, he often visited the hospital with his father, who was its chief physician. However, everything changed after a mysterious incident that resulted in the deaths of his father, as well as many patients and staff members. Many years have passed, but the circumstances of the tragedy have never been revealed. Unable to accept the uncertainty, Blake heads to the abandoned island to uncover the truth about the events of that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/60d5f978304ef99e12d6404a9dd5ae85.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/60d5f978304ef99e12d6404a9dd5ae85.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/60d5f978304ef99e12d6404a9dd5ae85.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Microphone Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In StillWake, your own voice can be the reason for your death. The game uses your microphone to detect the level of noise you make. If you speak too loudly or make too much noise, enemies may hear you and come looking for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/dd944886589dd60edb4e13c583c96b64.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/dd944886589dd60edb4e13c583c96b64.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/dd944886589dd60edb4e13c583c96b64.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having reached the island on an old fishing boat, the player will have to explore the gloomy corridors of the hospital, search for documents, gather evidence, and uncover the secrets of the past. Along the way, you will encounter various puzzles left behind by the facility's former staff. Madmen and horrifying mutants inhabit the inside of the hospital. You can hide from some enemies using closets, beds, and dark corners, while others will force you into combat, relying on a limited supply of weapons and ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/219846b34309a67a9de5d81c198998b1.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/219846b34309a67a9de5d81c198998b1.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/219846b34309a67a9de5d81c198998b1.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Location</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in an old psychiatric hospital located on a deserted island. The complex consists of three main levels: the basement floor, the main building, and the upper wing. Each part of the hospital has its own unique atmosphere, distinct puzzles, and residents who hide dark secrets of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/70541376bdc16ead96b9ec2998c3392d.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/70541376bdc16ead96b9ec2998c3392d.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/70541376bdc16ead96b9ec2998c3392d.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person survival horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging storyline with the gradual unraveling of a tragic mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of an abandoned psychiatric hospital on an isolated island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles based on documents, items, and observation skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and survival mechanics with limited resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere inspired by classic representatives of the survival horror genre.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/db5e421f727210ce2f7199c47aed7900.avif?t=1788205057\" width=735 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>StillWake -</strong> is an atmospheric first-person survival horror game set in an abandoned psychiatric hospital on a remote island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Blake Hale, works as a detective. In his childhood, he often visited the hospital with his father, who was its chief physician. However, everything changed after a mysterious incident that resulted in the deaths of his father, as well as many patients and staff members. Many years have passed, but the circumstances of the tragedy have never been revealed. Unable to accept the uncertainty, Blake heads to the abandoned island to uncover the truth about the events of that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/60d5f978304ef99e12d6404a9dd5ae85.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/60d5f978304ef99e12d6404a9dd5ae85.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/60d5f978304ef99e12d6404a9dd5ae85.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Microphone Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In StillWake, your own voice can be the reason for your death. The game uses your microphone to detect the level of noise you make. If you speak too loudly or make too much noise, enemies may hear you and come looking for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/dd944886589dd60edb4e13c583c96b64.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/dd944886589dd60edb4e13c583c96b64.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/dd944886589dd60edb4e13c583c96b64.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having reached the island on an old fishing boat, the player will have to explore the gloomy corridors of the hospital, search for documents, gather evidence, and uncover the secrets of the past. Along the way, you will encounter various puzzles left behind by the facility's former staff. Madmen and horrifying mutants inhabit the inside of the hospital. You can hide from some enemies using closets, beds, and dark corners, while others will force you into combat, relying on a limited supply of weapons and ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/219846b34309a67a9de5d81c198998b1.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/219846b34309a67a9de5d81c198998b1.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/219846b34309a67a9de5d81c198998b1.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Location</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in an old psychiatric hospital located on a deserted island. The complex consists of three main levels: the basement floor, the main building, and the upper wing. Each part of the hospital has its own unique atmosphere, distinct puzzles, and residents who hide dark secrets of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/70541376bdc16ead96b9ec2998c3392d.poster.avif?t=1788205057\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/70541376bdc16ead96b9ec2998c3392d.webm?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4853700/extras/70541376bdc16ead96b9ec2998c3392d.mp4?t=1788205057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person survival horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging storyline with the gradual unraveling of a tragic mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of an abandoned psychiatric hospital on an isolated island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles based on documents, items, and observation skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth and survival mechanics with limited resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere inspired by classic representatives of the survival horror genre.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "StillWake is an atmospheric first-person survival horror. Explore an abandoned psychiatric hospital, uncover its dark secrets, solve puzzles, and survive terrifying creatures. Stay quiet—your microphone picks up your voice, and enemies can hear you", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Malay, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russia